        "ws-file-separator-preserved": {
          "before": "be01fedac4053f4f",
          "after": "25a0970aa8efa4b6"
        },
        "lone-surrogate": {
          "before": "ERROR:UnicodeEncodeError",
          "after": "1ed51aa1b0212800"
        }
      },
      "impact": "Only snippets containing U+FEFF, U+001C-U+001F or U+0085 change, plus unpaired surrogates, which previously raised UnicodeEncodeError. The Python baseline writer is not on main; a baseline written from such a snippet reports that finding once as new; regenerate it with the baseline writer. Fingerprints already stored in metadata.fingerprint are still honoured verbatim and never recomputed."
    }
